sibile, Florence gli servirà un rovescio, costringendolo all'errore e alla resa totale."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Rolling to You","overview":"Jocelyn is a selfish and misogynist businessman. He tries to seduce a young pretty woman by pretending to be handicapped, till the day he meets her sister, who is also in a wheelchair."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Jocelyn, homme d'affaires en pleine réussite, égoïste et misogyne, lassé d'être lui-même, se retrouve malgré lui à séduire une jeune et jolie femme en se faisant passer pour un handicapé. Jusqu'au jour où elle lui présente sa sœur elle-même handicapée …"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wok93579iEtpjJ7bFLbAzjzl0jl.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f5GsxbAgEDl0kHUkxrl0da7QVta.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":458534,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wok93579iEtpjJ7bFLbAzjzl0jl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wok93579iEtpjJ7bFLbAzjzl0jl.jpg","language":"it","width":700,"height":980},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wok93579iEtpjJ7bFLbAzjzl0jl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wok93579iEtpjJ7bFLbAzjzl0jl.jpg","language":"it","width":700,"height":980},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5kzXupMWhiX4jOmy99NFPFVnphk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5kzXupMWhiX4jOmy99NFPFVnphk.jpg","language":"it","width":654,"height":980},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/goZvHsuBkUnYTiyyA09VG4CG5Qz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/goZvHsuBkUnYTiyyA09VG4CG5Qz.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"pos